From: Phil Taylor <phil@m0vse.uk>
Subject: ath79: preserve qualified E400 Gambit family port

Family-only hunks from frozen Gambit .12 parent f08f3456. Shared A/B
certificate/route policy comes from canonical patches 0126..0130.
Corrected-main integration has patch-replay proof, not a new image build.

